WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
The Burst Mode of Tohma's Determination

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:09.550
The Burst Mode of Tohma's Determination!

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:16.180
Masaru's father, Suguru, became the God of the Digital World and the humans' enemy.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.040
Deciding to meet his father once more and listen to his true feelings,

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:27.370
Masaru left Tohma and the others to protect Earth as he headed back to the Digital World.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:52.760
Meanwhile, the Royal Knights, with their subordinate Knightmon in tow,

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:54.760
began their invasion in every city around the world.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.690
Gale Claw!

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:07.940
Blast Wing!

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:14.250
Forbidden Temptation!

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:19.790
Roses Rapier!

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:23.590
They just keep coming!

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:26.780
Exactly how many are there?

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:30.960
In any case, we must hold back the Digimon invasion as much as we can.

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.240
Yes?

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:37.650
Is that you, Tohma?!

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:39.010
Yushima-san?

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:50.940
The man is crazy!

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.250
He's planning to takeoff?!

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:54.210
After all I went through to stop him!

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:00.130
Oh no!

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:02.280
DJ Shooter!

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.020
What's wrong?

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:14.900
What the hell are you doing?!

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.170
Father, what happened?

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.290
Stay inside!

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:23.030
I mean... it's dangerous.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:26.300
Father,

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.360
why are we leaving for home so suddenly?

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:32.500
Relena!

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:38.610
Somebody...

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.570
Somebody help us!

00:03:58.420 --> 00:03:59.230
That's...

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:01.490
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:20.570
No matter where you run off to right now, the situation will be the same.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:23.520
Please stop exposing Relena to unnecessary danger.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:26.840
I must return to Austria and protect our manor.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:30.040
You <i>know</i>  that flight takeoff is currently prohibited!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:33.590
That can be fixed just by mentioning the Norstein name.

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:35.780
That's not what you should be saying!

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:37.230
You dare to challenge your own father?!

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:39.520
Master...

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:44.550
I'm afraid a second squadron of troops will arrive.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.530
Please take shelter somewhere.

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:47.690
Take shelter?

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:48.710
Don't be stupid!

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:50.590
I'll have another jet prepared to take us home.

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:53.370
I just told you, you can't do that!

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.370
Then you'll act as our escort.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:59.330
You are really...

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:00.740
What?

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:03.810
Don't you at least want to protect your sister's life?

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:06.550
Then...

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.730
Then, what about you?

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:10.900
What?

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:15.060
What have you ever protected so far?

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:23.440
Tohma, it's time.

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:25.900
Let's go.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.070
Tohma.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:30.520
Okay.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:41.590
First Day of
Elementary School

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:46.270
Dad, wait a...!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.850
Why, Mother?!

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:07.590
This isn't a joke.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.540
I have no obligation to meet that child.

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:13.460
He's my son!

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:14.980
He's <i>your</i>  grandson!

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:18.060
Only through blood.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:21.250
That boy cannot be called a true Norstein.

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:22.920
Mother!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:27.760
Tohma!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:31.840
What are you doing over there?

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:33.350
Don't you know how to greet others?

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:38.730
How do you do, Grandmother?

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:45.110
His eyes are just like his mother's.

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:51.150
I'm sure it must have been easy for you to mislead that young and ignorant exchange student.

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:55.080
Listen closely.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.520
You are of the Norstein family,

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.010
yet at the same time, you are not.

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:01.790
You'll do well to continue bearing that in mind.

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:27.850
I will never forget what you did back then.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:29.860
You insulted my mother,

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:34.110
in the most despicable way, through your silence!

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:38.190
You know nothing.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:39.020
Nothing.

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:41.330
Master!

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:51.550
Do something, Tohma!

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:54.900
Since you're a Norstein, you should be able to do something!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.390
Her heart rate is accelerating!

00:07:58.760 --> 00:07:59.390
This is bad.

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:01.670
Master Franz!

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.100
Miss Relena is going into spasms!

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:05.740
What?!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.240
Well, then.

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:12.320
I guess it's time to show them how serious I can be.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:15.500
Digisoul...

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.500
Full Charge!

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.120
Gawappamon, evolve!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:34.970
Shawujingmon!

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:44.600
Shawujingmon

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:44.600
Perfect Level

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:36.890
Shawujingmon.

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:39.280
The Perfect Level Digimon who evolves from Kamemon.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:41.900
His special attack, Kouyoujyou: Taki-no-jin, comes from the staff he holds,

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:44.600
which smashes through solid earth and releases a raging stream of water.

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:48.790
Kouyoujyou: Taki-no-jin!

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:48.790
Descending Magical Staff: Waterfall Formation

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:06.960
Brother...

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:16.590
Was the baby born safely?

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:18.110
It's a girl.

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:19.390
A girl?

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:20.260
Yes.

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:20.940
However...

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:23.300
both the mother and child were in danger during the labor process...

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:24.230
Very well.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.940
Do everything you can to save the child's life.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:30.620
She is a precious child who has finally been born into the Norstein family.

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:49.620
So you're Relena.

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:55.010
Everyone is worrying for you.

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:34.390
I will do something...

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:35.540
for Relena's sake.

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:40.470
But I won't be doing it because I'm a Norstein!

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:43.730
Tohma!

00:10:47.150 --> 00:10:48.060
Master...

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:49.600
It's all right.

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:01.450
Digisoul Charge!

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:02.620
Overdrive!

00:11:04.150 --> 00:11:05.450
Gaomon, evolve!

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.050
MirageGaogamon!

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:22.600
Let's go!

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:23.790
Yes, Master!

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:31.390
Full Moon Blaster!

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.860
Thank you, MirageGaogamon!

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.070
Let's go!

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:40.040
Okay!

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:42.860
Yushima-san!

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:43.920
I apologize!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.280
For what?

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:48.740
This is just beginning.

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:51.080
Yes, sir.

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:54.760
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:11:58.060 --> 00:12:00.090
That's it, MirageGaogamon!

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:02.460
Take them down with one stroke!

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:03.430
Yes, Master.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.070
They're falling back.

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:36.370
RhodoKnightmon

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:36.370
Ultimate Level

00:12:27.150 --> 00:12:28.250
RhodoKnightmon.

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:31.170
An Ultimate Level Digimon who is also a Royal Knight.

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:33.200
His special attack is Argent Fear.

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:36.370
The Pile Bunker on his right arm sends forth shock waves.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:43.090
A-A Royal Knight?

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:44.170
Indeed.

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:49.890
You will pay for laying your hands on my subordinates.

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:52.850
Let's go, MirageGaogamon!

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:54.800
Yes, Master!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:56.480
Don't!

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:56.900
Tohma!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.400
Spiral Masquerade!

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:07.440
Fools.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:09.700
Damn it...

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.470
His composure is breaking...

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:14.660
Just as I assumed, he's agitated about something.

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:18.740
Her blood pressure has stabilized.

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:19.490
Doctor...

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:26.070
I...

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:27.480
I...

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.730
Tohma shall succeed the Norstein lineage.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.440
What did you just say?

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:43.300
Because of her weak body, Relena will not do.

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:48.850
Instead, arrange for a young lady of suitable pedigree to become Tohma's wife.

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:52.490
Choose one that will prevent others from talking behind our backs.

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:53.910
But Mother!

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:56.410
Understood?

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:00.780
Yes...

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.390
Master Franz!

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.990
Preparations for departure at the terminal are completed.

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.550
We must get Miss Relena there quickly.

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:12.580
Huh?

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:13.900
O-Oh...

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:14.890
Please hurry.

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:18.750
We must do this while Master Tohma is distracting them!

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:21.860
Tohma...

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:30.080
MirageGaogamon!

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:34.770
Spiral Masquerade!

00:14:43.050 --> 00:14:43.910
Kamemon!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:51.890
I admire you for your persistence and stubbornness,

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:55.190
but it does not change the conclusion of this battle.

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:56.820
Argent Fear!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:03.820
MirageGaogamon!

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.610
Transport her as quickly as you can!

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:15.860
Hurry!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:19.520
Brother...

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:22.150
No...

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.530
Don't go...!

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:24.810
Miss Relena!

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:25.960
You must stay calm...!

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:27.880
Relena!

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:30.840
Brother!

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:36.050
RELENA!

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:04.620
Tohma...

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.010
Brother...

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:09.730
Relena!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:10.980
Relena!

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:20.670
Even I...

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:24.340
Even I have acted out of desperation.

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:30.400
I always did everything in my power to protect the Norstein family's name!

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:39.380
Father...

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:08.130
Father.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.660
Please take care of Relena.

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:12.190
Tohma?

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.650
I will protect you.

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:20.870
I'll make sure to protect you.

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:24.370
I won't let them lay a finger on Relena, either.

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:30.290
Yes, Master.

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:36.420
RhodoKnightmon!

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:39.470
You won't get away with this any longer!

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:41.820
With my name, Tohma Norstein, on the line...

00:17:41.820 --> 00:17:43.140
I will defeat you!

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:46.290
You will defeat me?

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:49.730
Even as a joke, that is quite insulting.

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:52.360
Such a sin is punishable by death!

00:17:57.450 --> 00:17:58.950
He stopped it...!

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.540
Let's go, MirageGaogamon!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:16.890
Charge!

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:21.470
Digisoul Burst!

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:44.600
MirageGaogamon!

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.130
Burst Mode!

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:56.550
MirageGaogamon

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:56.550
Burst Mode

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.400
MirageGaogamon Burst Mode.

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:54.090
The appearance MirageGaogamon takes on after using Burst Evolution to temporarily activate the limits of his power.

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:56.550
His special attack is Full Moon Meteor Impact.

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:00.590
This is...

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:02.550
This is my...

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:04.360
Burst Mode!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.850
What a silly trick.

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:11.730
Go, MirageGaogamon!

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:13.490
Yes, Master!

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:25.100
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:25.100
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.150
Don't be impertinent!

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:24.450
Wh-What?

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:30.060
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:30.060
<b>You'll understand what I mean after the day you realize that</b>

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:30.370
Spiral Masquerade!

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:32.170
<b>furue wo tomete</b>

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:32.170
<b>Stop your trembling</b>

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:35.790
<b>hitomi wo hirake</b>

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:35.790
<b>Open your eyes</b>

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:40.600
<b>kimi no jikan wo tokihanate!</b>

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:40.600
<b>And liberate your time!</b>

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.490
Wh-What is this power?

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:44.560
<b>mirai e Shootin' star!</b>

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:44.560
<b>Oh shootin' star to the future!</b>

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:45.970
Leave the human world, RhodoKnightmon!

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:47.850
<b>hikari no aachi egake</b>

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:47.850
<b>Draw an arch of light</b>

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:50.330
Speaking to me in that manner...

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:53.120
<b>todoku no sa shinjitsuzukeru naraba</b>

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:53.120
<b>As long as you keep believing, it'll reach up there</b>

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.670
is unforgivable!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.440
Argent Fear!

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:58.920
<b>kimi wo yobu koe ga kokoro de hajiketara</b>

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:58.920
<b>When the voice that calls you bellows with the heart</b>

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:56.410
Full Moon Meteor Impact!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:05.090
<b>subete ga hajimaru Believer!</b>

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:05.090
<b>That's when everything will begin, Believer!</b>

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:03.370
I-It can't be!

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:27.970
I see.

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:29.060
So you're leaving.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:30.170
Yes.

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:32.860
Will it be all right?

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:34.250
Set your mind at ease.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.230
Relena has already settled down.

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:37.700
No.

00:20:38.930 --> 00:20:40.240
I was talking about you.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:42.990
Will you be able to come back home safely?

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.220
I'll be fine.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.460
After all...

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:51.440
I am a Norstein.

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:54.440
I see.

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:04.540
Thank you.

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:05.920
It's all right.

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:13.290
Let's go... to help Masaru.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.330
Yes, Master!

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:18.230
He'd rather face the danger than wait for it to come, is it?

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:20.330
{onkei: I find it amusing that they still kept Masaru in the credits just for title call. I wonder if he had to sit through the whole thing.} {Splash: XD...}

