00:22:09.270 --> 00:22:12.270
<b>ENDING THEME 

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:38.880
Ikuto! It's a Royal Knight!

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:40.310
That's Duftmon!

00:22:40.310 --> 00:22:45.230
He says he doesn't mind sacrificing the Digimon if it means saving the Digital World!

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:46.200
Duftmon!

00:22:46.200 --> 00:22:47.680
You're wrong!

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:50.340
Your one-sided justice isn't justice at all!

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:53.210
I... will protect this place where everyone lives!

00:22:53.210 --> 00:22:55.130
Let's go, Falcomon!

